"],["5de387fd_156f6403",68,-2,1,"```suggestion # The format is defined by the `AnnotatedPageContent` message in ``` I do not seem to find a PageContent message."],["696a37ac_ed68be00",64,-2,1,"is this include needed?"],["6e2ea0b4_b70597ea",69,-2,1,"`std::string`"],["6e6d1dda_f1cf455f",70,-2,1,"Let's make the callback return an optional so failure is explicit."],["7f887bd8_574cdbd2",70,-2,1,"`std::string`"],["97f41ee9_bf22290d",67,-2,1,"Nit: `include_actionable_information`?"],["9f1f39f2_f0b3ad64",70,-2,1,"Do you really need this include? The signature of the method doesn't have AIPageContent or anything specific to this piece of functionality."],["a0298195_84718abd",65,-2,0,"FWIW, we prefer dealing with typed data. Opaque strings are very easy target for attackers to smuggle invalid data. I don't know whether this is possible to avoid here, just sharing a point of view."],["a721cd7c_aa8dd439",64,-2,1,"Nit: `include_actional_information`?"],["a9d58e3f_dc830a4a",69,-2,1,"nit: There's a helper to generate the actionable version, prefer using that."],["bb36505e_9a42aa6b",65,-2,1,"nit: WebContents"],["c683c2a6_2d08cb04",71,-2,1,"Does it make sense to test the mock? Should we add a test next to chrome/browser/devtools/protocol/devtools_protocol_browsertest.cc (on the chrome// level) instead?"],["cb48e677_c83a0850",69,-2,1,"Optional nit: How do you feel about this? ```suggestion optimization_guide::GetAIPageContent( web_contents, std::move(options), base::BindOnce(…"],["e3b7e2ef_989aade2",66,-2,1,"`std::string`"],["e8e5a6ea_0f1f5e89",13,-2,1,"components?"],["6bc71f07_7ba04a06",65,-1,1,"Is //content/ supposed to be dependent on optimization_guide? This is a bit unexpected. I don't see any changes to DEPS in this CL and there is no existing dependency I can see on the…"],["b7ae4224_71bdd8ee",13,-1,1,"Unnecessary prefix? The bug is public, so it does not require b: prefix. Bug: will be sufficient for it to linkify correctly."],["cc9af755_ef6f2aa3",65,0,1,"nit: AnnotatedPageContent proto"]],0,104],[7106149,20426,29,0.714,0.533,[[0,0.6,14,19],[5,0.257,18,7],[6,0.143,8,3]],[["45004702_37929dba",23,-3,1,"Can you please update [the test client](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:chrome/test/data/webui/glic/test_client/sections/get_page_context.ts;l=30;drc=8d98a27da0c1f38855880fec4…"],["65840af5_1d4b35ab",72,-1,0,"Can you pls remove these changes from this CL?"]],0,105],[7225795,20426,4,0.248,0.178,[[5,0.5,19,2],[0,0.5,15,2]],[["6e682b65_f1c560a4",73,-1,0,"Hmm, I thought every node would have at least one contentAttribute set. Why do we need this?"]],0,106]]}